      "text": "Composition\n-> Compose functions. Function composition is the application\nof one function to the result of another to produce a third function",
      "fontSize": 19.9848081581387,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Composition\n-> Compose functions. Function composition is the application\nof one function to the result of another to produce a third function",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
