      "text": "Lifting\n- Lift a partial function into a total function\n- Returns an Option result\n- If the function is called with a disallowed input value -> throw exception\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lifting\n- Lift a partial function into a total function\n- Returns an Option result\n- If the function is called with a disallowed input value -> throw exception\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
