      "updated": 1756574824332,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Currying\n- Partially apply a function by fixing a value for one of the params \nResulting in a Function1 function that return a Function1\n- When a Function2 is curried, the result is indistinguishable from the partial application of\na Function2 because both result in a 1-arity function.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Currying\n- Partially apply a function by fixing a value for one of the params \nResulting in a Function1 function that return a Function1\n- When a Function2 is curried, the result is indistinguishable from the partial application of\na Function2 because both result in a 1-arity function.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
